WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.333
(crunching)

00:00:03.457 --> 00:00:05.668
(whooshing, squeaking)

00:00:05.668 --> 00:00:08.168
(jazzy music)

00:00:21.088 --> 00:00:22.271
- We have rice,

00:00:22.271 --> 00:00:23.242
there's salmon,

00:00:23.242 --> 00:00:26.394
and then there's like
onions and, I think, mango.

00:00:26.394 --> 00:00:28.390
It smells like sushi and
it looks like a taco.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.965
- Have you ever seen
anything more beautiful?

00:00:29.965 --> 00:00:32.792
It's a taco combined with
sushi, two of my favorite foods.

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:35.660
And then this is like a
crunchy tempura seaweed.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:39.238
- I think anything shaped
like a taco is a win.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:41.817
(crunching)

00:00:41.817 --> 00:00:42.650
- Mmm

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.449
It kind of tastes like
something with tempura on it.

00:00:45.449 --> 00:00:46.282
- I like it a lot.

00:00:46.282 --> 00:00:48.510
So many different textures, flavors.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:49.688
Crunchy, soft.

00:00:49.688 --> 00:00:51.951
- I think it could use more
of a vegetable element.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:54.554
Like, in the cross-section
it's pretty much just raw fish

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.623
and then rice underneath,

00:00:55.623 --> 00:00:57.625
so it's kind of soft on soft.

00:00:57.625 --> 00:00:59.558
I wish there was like raw cucumber

00:00:59.558 --> 00:01:04.377
or like an avocado layer
or something like that.

00:01:04.377 --> 00:01:07.357
(crunching)

00:01:07.357 --> 00:01:09.656
- I feel like there could be more flavor.

00:01:09.656 --> 00:01:10.489
They're slightly bland.

00:01:10.489 --> 00:01:12.559
I do like bland foods, though.

00:01:12.559 --> 00:01:13.588
(crunching, laughing)

00:01:13.588 --> 00:01:14.650
- I like the crunch.

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:16.491
The rice is just like filler,

00:01:16.491 --> 00:01:18.234
fish tastes fresh, I love mangoes.

00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:21.091
- I don't like mangoes, but I
liked it which is interesting.

00:01:21.091 --> 00:01:22.021
- You don't like mangoes?

00:01:22.021 --> 00:01:22.854
What's wrong with you?

00:01:22.854 --> 00:01:23.716
- I don't really like mangoes.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:24.549
I don't know.

00:01:24.549 --> 00:01:26.415
- It really just feels like raw fish

00:01:26.415 --> 00:01:28.069
inside something crunchy.

00:01:28.069 --> 00:01:28.902
- Wow!

00:01:28.902 --> 00:01:30.695
You would not think that
this would work out.

00:01:30.695 --> 00:01:33.611
It's like super crispy,
and like I love seaweed,

00:01:33.611 --> 00:01:35.261
and there's rice and I love rice.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:38.380
- The tempura seaweed as
a shell, stroke of genius.

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:39.966
This is a symphony of flavor.

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:41.238
Follow-up question, where do I get this?

00:01:41.238 --> 00:01:42.071
Who makes this?

00:01:42.071 --> 00:01:44.137
- I don't even know if you
could consider it sushi,

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:46.492
but it's like a sushi-inspired taco.

00:01:46.492 --> 00:01:48.233
It has a really good flavor, though.

00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:49.419
I really like it.

00:01:49.419 --> 00:01:51.309
- It's good, I would
eat this again for sure.

00:01:51.309 --> 00:01:52.725
- Can we keep this?

00:01:52.725 --> 00:01:54.321
- 10 out of 10 would eat again.

00:01:54.321 --> 00:01:56.337
- You wanna try it?

00:01:56.337 --> 00:01:57.875
Mmm.

00:01:57.875 --> 00:02:00.439
Yes, camera, eat the taco.

00:02:00.439 --> 00:02:02.939
(jazzy music)

00:02:06.199 --> 00:02:08.449
(whooshing, squeaking)

